1. Credential patterns

   The SECRETS list in agents/security-reviewer/scripts/secrets.mjs is copied, with changes,
   from agents/publisher/scripts/inspect.mjs in The Agent Development Lifecycle
   (https://github.com/CommonAgent/adlc, commit fa174cf88c22db8599f6447dbc40740cf046c36a),
   Copyright 2026 Jeff Schneider, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). Changes: the PKCS#12 keystore pattern is written with -{5} for
   its dashes; each entry carries a `what` naming its kind; carriesASecret is rewritten and
   secretsIn is added. The NOTICE of that work reads:

